+			// turn MOVD $sym (adrp+add) into MOVD sym@GOT (adrp+ldr).
+			// On Haiku (ELF) every libroot service is reached by taking the
+			// address of a cgo_import_dynamic function pointer, so this path
+			// is on the hot path for the whole runtime, not just Darwin.
 			if r.Add() != 0 {
